<head>
    <meta name="description" content="About the Dreego plugin showcase">
</head>

<go>
    heading := "About This Demo"
</go>

<div>
    <h1>{{ heading }}</h1>
    <p>This is a Dreego web application that demonstrates the plugin ecosystem. It uses three runtime plugins:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>plugin-example</strong> — a greeting and health endpoint</li>
        <li><strong>plugin-sse</strong> — Server-Sent Events for real-time server-to-client streaming</li>
        <li><strong>plugin-websocket</strong> — WebSocket for bidirectional real-time communication</li>
    </ul>
    <p>All plugins use the Go standard library only. The app is a single binary with no runtime external dependencies.</p>
    <p><a href="/">Back to home</a></p>
</div>